type_pe_determ_typed=∀(tenv :type_env) (tenvE :tenv_val_exp) (p :pat) (e :exp). type_pe_determ tenv tenvE p e ⇔ ∀(t1 :t) (tenv1 :(mlstring # t) list) (t2 :t) (tenv2 :(mlstring # t) list). type_p (0 :num) tenv p t1 tenv1 ∧ type_e tenv tenvE e t1 ∧ type_p (0 :num) tenv p t2 tenv2 ∧ type_e tenv tenvE e t2 ⇒ tenv1 = tenv2
